Maximum logit error after remapping node IDs 0.
\image(figures/graphsage_fit.svg)
// result_end
\caption(Held-out node classification loss and accuracy after each four-update epoch.)
\alttext(Line plots of negative log likelihood and accuracy on the separate 60-node graph.)

The same parameters work at either node count. Reordering the graph and
remapping the sampled neighbor IDs together changes only the output order.

> Reference

- [Hamilton, Ying, and Leskovec (2017), Inductive Representation Learning on Large Graphs](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.02216).
